    <string name="theme_holo_ics" translatable="false">Android 4.0 Ice Cream Sandwich (Holo)</string>
    <string name="theme_material_you_summary">Android 12–15 · Material You and Material Design 3, with wallpaper colors and tonal surfaces.</string>
    <string name="theme_miuix_summary">miuix native controls and motion. Android 13+ is this app’s runtime requirement, not a historical design version.</string>
    <string name="theme_holo_ics_summary">Android 4.0 Ice Cream Sandwich · Holo lines and classic blue accents.</string>
    <string name="theme_liquid_glass_navigation_bar">Floating tab bar</string>
    <string name="theme_liquid_glass_navigation_bar_summary">Float the tab bar above the page with a glass effect.</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Fuyao Locale began with VegaBobo’s Language Selector and rewrites its main implementation. System language features draw on Nightdavisao’s MultiLocale. The floating glass tab bar builds on AndroidLiquidGlass and miuix, which also provides interface components. Thank you to their authors and contributors.</string>
    <string name="about_license">AGPL-3.0-only. Upstream code and resources retain their licenses and attribution; see the repository NOTICE.</string>
